{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/13361", "id": 1601758001, "node_id": "PR_kwDOAEfiCM5feOMx", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/13361", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/13361.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/13361.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/13361", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/13361/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/13361/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/13361/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/statuses/cca16af8c5b2e77667135366c89163e77323fef1", "number": 13361, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fix order dependent tests in `InternalThreadLocalTest`", "user": {"login": "saaivenk", "id": 46614118, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjE0MTE4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46614118?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk", "html_url": "https://github.com/saaivenk", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## What is the purpose of the change\r\n\r\n- In `dubbo-common`, several test cases in the test class `dubbo-common,org.apache.dubbo.common.threadlocal.InternalThreadLocalTest.java` can trigger `java.lang.ClassCastException`, when being run after the unit test in `testConstructionWithIndex()` in the same class because it pollutes state shared among tests.\r\n- It may be good to clean this state pollution so that some other tests do not fail in the future due to the shared state polluted by this test.\r\n\r\nIssue Link: [DUBBO-13359](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues/13359)\r\n\r\n## Brief changelog\r\n- Changed `nextIndex.get()` to `nextIndex.incrementAndGet()` in `InternalThreadLocalTest.java` to properly restore the polluted state `InternalThreadLocalMap.NEXT_INDEX`\r\n\r\n## Verifying this change\r\n- With the proposed fix, the test does not pollute the shared state.\r\n- All the tests pass when run in the any order.\r\n\r\n<!-- Follow this checklist to help us incorporate your contribution quickly and easily: -->\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n- [x] Make sure there is a [GitHub_issue](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues) field for the change (usually before you start working on it). Trivial changes like typos do not require a GitHub issue. Your pull request should address just this issue, without pulling in other changes - one PR resolves one issue.\r\n- [ ] Each commit in the pull request should have a meaningful subject line and body.\r\n- [X] Write a pull request description that is detailed enough to understand what the pull request does, how, and why.\r\n- [ ] Check if is necessary to patch to Dubbo 3 if you are work on Dubbo 2.7\r\n- [ ] Write necessary unit-test to verify your logic correction, more mock a little better when cross module dependency exist. If the new feature or significant change is committed, please remember to add sample in [dubbo samples](https://github.com/apache/dubbo-samples) project.\r\n- [ ] Add some description to [dubbo-website](https://github.com/apache/dubbo-website) project if you are requesting to add a feature.\r\n- [x] GitHub Actions works fine on your own branch.\r\n- [ ] If this contribution is large, please follow the [Software Donation Guide](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/wiki/Software-donation-guide).\r\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2023-11-15T02:06:05Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-28T23:17:13Z", "closed_at": "2023-11-15T06:04:38Z", "merged_at": "2023-11-15T06:04:38Z", "merge_commit_sha": "27e9877620a03a2e6c3aeabb5cc1d66c30eb188d", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "saaivenk:fix-order-dependent-tests-in-InternalThreadLocalTest", "ref": "fix-order-dependent-tests-in-InternalThreadLocalTest", "repo": {"id": 718824922, "node_id": "R_kgDOKthl2g", "name": "dubbo", "full_name": "saaivenk/dubbo", "owner": {"login": "saaivenk", "id": 46614118, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjE0MTE4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46614118?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk", "html_url": "https://github.com/saaivenk", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "private": false, "fork": true, "archived": false, "disabled": false, "description": "The java implementation of Apache Dubbo. An RPC and microservice framework.", "hom